  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Updraging the 70 km long &quot;Joydevpur-Chandra-Tangail-Elenga&quot; road from (1X1) to (2X2) in addition to road attachments and bridges. ADFD funds the 10 km (WP04) package from Tangail to Elenga in cooperation with the Bengal government. The OPEC fund and Asian</narrative>
